WEBVTT

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:12.660
Touko.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.200
We're going to say hello to the chief priest.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.830
Okay. I'll wait here.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:36.620
NANAMI
FAMILY
GRAVE

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.370
Summer vacation will end soon.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:32.870
Practice for the stage show will resume,
and the anniversary of my sister's death will pass.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:34.790
Then the culture festival will begin.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.700
I'm going to see it through, okay?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.250
I'll do what you never got the chance to... in your place.

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.040
If I do that, then...

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.200
Then, I will...

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.500
Oh, welcome.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.410
Hello. Can we get a table in the back?

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:14.250
Feel free to sit anywhere you like.

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:16.660
Homework?

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:18.160
Um, not really.

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:21.410
Oh, then it must be the stage show.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.450
You can take all the time you like.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.790
There aren't many customers since
the Obon Festival just ended.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:28.500
Thank you very much.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:32.000
I'd like the shrimp pilaf lunch with an iced coffee please.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.080
Same for me.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:33.910
Sure thing.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:41.200
Um, how far did we get last time?

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:45.580
I thought we talked about adding
in a new scene after this part here.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:48.950
Right, I remember now.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:54.750
But if we do that, then making sure it's consistent
with the other scenes is going to be difficult.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.330
I see...

00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:01.580
For now let's just decide what
we want to do and I'll write it out.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.660
We can adjust everything to be consistent afterwards.

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:06.160
Isn't that more difficult?

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:12.200
I'm willing to put in as much effort as necessary
to make it interesting, it's not a problem for me.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:13.830
But...

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:18.160
I think this will probably result in...

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.580
...your character having a lot more lines than before.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:23.370
Is that okay?

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:27.410
I'm the one who suggested the change,
of course I'll do it.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.000
This still needs work...

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:40.040
When Nanami-senpai reads the new script,
I wonder what she'll have to say?

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:45.410
I want to see her.... at least I think I do.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:50.870
But, I can't be the one who...

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:52.620
Yuu?

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.450
What?

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:57.120
I have one more favor to ask you.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.040
Okay.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:01.370
Will you help me think of the title, too?

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.370
The title of the show?

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:10.790
Yeah. I thought I might come up with something
while I was writing, but it's really difficult.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.080
It's just been like this the whole time.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.500
Student Council Stage Show

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.500
I see.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.200
Okay, sure.

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:21.500
I'm not sure if it will do any good,
but I'll give it some thought.

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:23.500
Thank you, come again.

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.830
Hello.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:39.040
Welcome. Table for two?

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:39.910
Yes.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.450
You two sure are close.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:46.160
I hear you had a study camp for the Student Council?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.120
Yes, to practice for the show.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.950
Then Riko must have worked you all pretty hard, right?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:57.250
Yep. Both Hakozaki-sensei and one of the people
from her theater troupe helped us out.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.660
The theater troupe? Oh...

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:03.950
Was that person a man or a woman?

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:07.830
It was a man. He used to go to our school.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.250
Hmph.

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.040
"Hmph"?

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:13.500
What?

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.750
Okay, I'll have an iced tea.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.790
I'll have an iced coffee.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.250
Coming right up.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.700
During the Obon Festival you went
to your parent's hometown, right?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:30.750
Yeah.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:32.700
How was it?

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.120
Nothing special.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:42.870
Really? Both of my parents are from this area,
so we never have trips like that. I'm a little jealous.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.200
We just went to the countryside.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:49.370
We visited my grandfather's house
and went to the family grave...

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.910
For your sister?

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:53.450
Yeah.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:58.500
Hey...

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.120
What?

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.500
Can you tell me what your sister was like?

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:12.080
But if you'd rather not talk about her, that's okay.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.370
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:36.950
I can only talk about my sister as I knew her.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:42.120
I'm not sure if that was actually the real her or not.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.870
Well, that's still part of who she was.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:54.910
The sister that you knew was one part
of the real her, I have no doubt.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:59.040
So I'd like to hear what kind of person she was to you.

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:00.910
Okay.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:05.330
Thank you, come again.

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.040
Well, see you when school starts again.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.660
The smell of incense...

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.200
Keep it together.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:54.500
I have to keep playing the role
of my sister until the very end!

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.830
I can't afford to hesitate and stop at this point.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:06.700
LOCAL TRAIN
This train will arrive at the last stop before the express train.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.080
But...

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:09.000
...what about after we finish the show?

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:13.790
From then on, where can I go?

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.450
I don't know.

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:39.330
It's times like these I want to be with Yuu.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:44.830
When I'm struggling,
I want to hear her say "it's all right".

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.330
Understood 
Please and thanks
I want to see you

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:51.830
She did tell me that she was okay
with me indulging myself, but...

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:55.330
I want to see you

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.330
Want to hang out somewhere together?

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:56.450
Huh?

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.370
From Yuu?!

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.540
Want to hang somewhere together?
I want to see you

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.290
I want to see you

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.290
Read

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.330
You're still here.

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:17.580
Welcome back.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.410
I'm home.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.250
Oh, you don't have to worry about your cigarette.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.370
But you hate them.

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:28.250
If you smoke at home I'll get upset,
but it's fine in the shop.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.330
Oh? Then maybe one more.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:31.950
Before you do that...

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.660
...could I get a cup of coffee?

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.290
Coming right up.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:47.290
Say Riko... do you prefer men or women?

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.040
Huh? What kind of question is that?

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:54.790
Nothing, it's just... I know that
you're willing to date both ways, right?

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:57.200
But, I figured maybe you have a preference.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:04.410
To be honest I don't have a special interest in women.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.410
Wait, wait, I'm sorry!

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:15.500
I'm not especially attracted to women,
but the fact that I'm dating you right now is different.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:19.330
You're special, maybe an exception, or something like...

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.080
"Something like" what?

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.370
You know what I'm trying to say, right?

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.580
I want to hear you say it.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.450
Jeez, cut it out.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.910
Come on, it's time to go. I'm starving!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.200
Sure.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:36.620
Oh, that's right. Those girls from
the Student Council were here today.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:37.660
Huh?

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:41.040
I really hope they don't keep coming so often...

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.500
I think they were talking about the stage show.

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:47.620
I see, they're really serious about it.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.160
Is it going to be good?

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:51.410
Yeah.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:10:00.910
To the Last Stop

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:06.000
Lighthouse

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:14.950
We made it!

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:21.870
It says there's a dolphin show at 1 p.m.
and then the penguins go for a walk at 3 p.m.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.000
And after that...

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.910
You're really into this.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:29.500
Huh?

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.000
Do you like going to aquariums, too?

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.700
But, I was a little surprised.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:38.620
I never thought I would get an invite from you.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:43.870
I was free and wanted to go have fun somewhere,
but figured everyone else must be busy.

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.950
They have a jellyfish exhibit! With lots of jellyfish!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.120
You really like jellyfish, huh?

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:55.830
There's that keychain on your phone, too.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:57.500
My keychain?

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:01.700
This isn't a jellyfish, it's a flapjack octopus.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.580
What's a "flapjack octopus"?

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.500
I can't believe you don't know!

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.700
Huh? Wha?

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.580
Whoa... what is this thing?

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.620
I wonder how they end up such a pretty color like that.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:20.500
The 1 p.m. dolphin show will be starting momentarily.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:21.950
Huh? Already?

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:25.160
You were really taking your time
looking at the last exhibit.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.450
Was I? Um...

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.330
It's this way.

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:35.290
Wow, this place is huge.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.620
The seats are mostly filled up already.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:40.540
Oh, but there's still a bunch left up at the front.

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:42.040
Look, over there!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:44.870
It's totally empty.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.910
I wonder why?

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:50.750
It doesn't look like these
are reserved for anybody special.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.290
Those sitting in the front will get splashed during the performance.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.120
Oh...

00:11:55.120 --> 00:12:00.250
You will get soaked head to toe,
so please be aware when choosing your seats.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:06.660
Soaked? But, I don't think senpai
is the type who would go for that...

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.200
I'm sure they must be exaggerating
about the whole head to toe thing.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:13.450
I know, right? They have to be.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.370
It looks like they're selling ponchos.

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:17.620
For how much?

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:18.950
100 yen.

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:21.250
That's cheap.

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:24.450
I'll go buy a couple!

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:25.750
I'll save your seat!

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.790
Now, it's time for the big jump!

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:38.870
Jump!

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.950
Jeez, even my hair got wet.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:57.200
They weren't kidding about getting
soaked head to toe, were they?

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.450
Not at all.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:01.200
Are your shoes okay?

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.540
Mine got pretty wet.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.000
I'd like to come again.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:12.040
We still have over half of the aquarium to see.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.620
I know, but...

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:22.080
...I want to come again, and I'd like to go
to other aquariums, and movie theaters and parks.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:24.370
Let's see, what else?

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.660
I'd like to climb a mountain!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.080
Why a mountain?

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:33.750
It doesn't have to be a mountain, but I'd like
to do something outdoorsy with you!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.580
I love you.

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:42.040
Senpai, you...

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:46.500
You really use that word freely with no hesitation.

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.910
Shouldn't you be a little more shy about it?

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.700
I don't really know the feeling myself, though.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.540
I wonder?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.580
Saying it makes me feel relieved.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:12.450
Just saying it? I would have thought it's more about
how the person on the receiving end reacts to it.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:19.620
I think I'm just relieved by the fact
that I can fall in love with someone.

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:27.370
Probably because I never once saw
my sister fall in love with anyone.

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.830
Oh, is that so?

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:39.500
Well, it's possible that I just didn't know
whether she had someone like that or not.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:50.790
But even if the rest of me is a lie,
I can say with confidence the part that likes you is not.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:53.750
That's why I feel relieved, I guess!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:05.290
Relieved to have proof of yourself, despite
the fact you just want to become your sister. That's...

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:12.290
I realize that seems self-contradictory, though.

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:20.250
I think... it's fine for people to be
self-contradictory, honestly.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.160
Looks like we're a little early.

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:42.500
Want to go look somewhere else?

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.620
It would be a pain to come back later, though.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.410
Nanami-senpai.

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.450
What?

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:53.410
We've got some time to kill, so would you be
interested in practicing for the show?

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:54.950
Right here?

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:56.200
Please excuse m-

00:15:56.660 --> 00:16:01.370
Oh! You're awake! I'll go get the doctor right now.

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:09.370
There's... nobody around.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:18.200
I can't remember anything.
Not who I was, or anything else...

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.120
Are you okay?!

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:27.620
Nurse, I'm... afraid.
I'm afraid of not knowing who I am.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.290
What kind of person was I before?

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:32.700
I don't know.

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:34.830
Wait, was that your line?

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:37.790
I'm improvising. The script isn't finished.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:43.910
Koyomi told me that she wants to change the script,
so I figured we might find something to help her.

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.080
I don't know.

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:49.620
Y-you don't know? Then what should I do?

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:56.000
Well, let's see. How about you ask the people who
come to visit you, and hear about yourself from them?

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.000
Hear about myself?

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:04.790
Although, you might hear very different things
about yourself from all of them.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:11.910
You might feel like you have to pick one version of
yourself from multiple that exist.

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:16.830
If that happens, how should I choose...?

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:20.290
Is there really a need for you to make that choice?

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:21.000
Huh?

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:27.250
I don't know anything about you aside
from our interactions here.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:35.950
But from that I know your habits, your favorite
novels, and even what color of flowers you like.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.250
I don't know anyone aside from "you".

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:53.790
But I have to choose someone to be,
because I have no memories at all.

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:57.120
I have nothing... to define me.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:04.040
Is that so?

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:06.700
Yes.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.080
But...

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:19.370
The penguin parade will be starting momentarily.
Please hurry if you wish to see it.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.620
People are already gathering!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.160
Let's go!

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:40.910
Nanami-senpai!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.000
Stay still, stay still!

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.620
Hurry up!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.870
Senpai, check it out!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:12.620
Are you listening? This one is a spotted eel,
and this is a garden eel.

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:14.200
R-right.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:15.790
So expensive...

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:23.620
My horoscope on TV today said my luck was
the best possible! I think I can do it.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:24.790
Go for it!

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.500
Come on secret metal flapjack octopus!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.370
Pitiful, yet adorable.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.000
Okay, let's open them together.

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:37.080
Sure, let's do it.

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:38.950
Ready...go!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.620
It suits you.

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.160
You think so?

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:52.620
Yuu!

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:55.120
Huh?

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:56.950
...Yuu?

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.080
This way.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:14.450
I wish

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:16.290
this would
never end...

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:30.120
The exit...

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.120
we're here already.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:38.330
Yo, Maki!

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:39.660
Let's go!

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:45.290
Oh, Ogaki-senpai. Are you finished with practice?

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:49.120
